'''Darksword''' is a [[Godly Weapons|godly]] knife that was originally obtainable by purchasing it individually from the [[Darksword Gamepass]] for 1,699 Robux or from the [[Darkness Bundle]] for 3,399 Robux during the [[Halloween Event 2023|2023 Halloween Event]]. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended.

==Appearance==
It takes the design of a huntress dagger, but with a dark, eerie theme to it, and matte black, hence the name. Its blade has a rounded, sharp edge with an elegant, swirly pattern in the middle of it. The guard takes a classy, royal design, and the handle reciprocates, but with an additional sharp pommel.

==Trivia==
*It partners with the [[Godly Weapons|godly]] gun [[Darkshot]], making the [https://murder-mystery-2.fandom.com/wiki/Murder_Mystery_2_Wiki:Wiki-Bot/Dark_Set Dark Set].
*This and its partner gun are the seventh gamepass weapons where you had the option to buy it as part of a bundle or separately, the others being [[Waves]], [[Ocean]], [[Rainbow (Godly)|Rainbow]], [[Rainbow Gun (Godly)|Rainbow Gun]], [[Sakura]], [[Blossom]], [[Phantom]], [[Spectre]], [[Plasmablade]], [[Plasmabeam]], [[Iceflake]], and [[Icebeam]].

